# R133: S3 as a statement call: v306 accepted it (and printed 99 by its argument order). Refused from v307, as the direct statement call is.
prakriya badal(vibhag s, ignored) {
    s[0] = 99
    nivartanam 0
}
mukhya() {
    kosh k[1]
    kosh_kship(k, 7)
    vitti obstacle = nirmmita(16)
    vitti f = badal
    f(k[0:1], kosh_kship(k, 8))
    likha(k[0])
}
